{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04933","headline":"饯唐州高使君 · 岑羲","name":"饯唐州高使君","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"苍茫南塞地，明媚上春时。\n目极伤千里，怀君不自持。\n征车别岐路，斜日下崦嵫。\n一叹轺轩阻，悠悠即所思。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑羲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04933.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04933","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}